    "updated_at": "2023-03-05T15:43:59Z",
    "body": "<s>So currently `<form method=dialog rel=noopener>` fails to submit (due to an early return) and with this change it would succeed (or at least continue beyond that point). Seems reasonable to me for the reason you state.</s>\r\n\r\nEdit: this analysis was incorrect. The problem is that we end up creating a top-level navigable we don't need.",
