    "body": "Presumably we just have to move\r\n\r\n> If the value of method is [dialog](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#attr-fs-method-dialog) then jump to the [submit dialog](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#submit-dialog) steps.\r\n\r\nup? Makes sense to ignore action parsing as well. (Ideally we'd not have \"jump\", but that's a bit more effort.)",
