    "body": "Sounds good to me. Based on what I'm reading in chromium it seems like this is what we are already doing.\r\nThe [check for method=dialog](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/forms/html_form_element.cc;l=481-484;drc=fcc13b7aa51f368288cef07876d95567a0e16125) comes before what I believe is the [check for the target navigable](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/forms/html_form_element.cc;l=531-532;drc=fcc13b7aa51f368288cef07876d95567a0e16125).",
